  foreverChanges = {
    "Zone fishing tiers are unchanged from Classic (1/25, 1/75, 55/150, 130/225, 205/300, 330/425) per wow.gg and wowhandbook Forever tables and the Forever wiki zone pages. The wiki's Forever_fishing_techniques page wording ('once you meet it all catches succeed') conflicts with Tavern/wow.gg, which still describe a getaway band.",
    "Fishing buff foods (Well Fed, eat 10s): Loch Frenzy Delight 6316 +3 (lvl 5), Fillet of Frenzy 5476 +5 (lvl 5), Bristle Whisker Catfish 4593 +8 (lvl 15), Rockscale Cod 4594 +12 (lvl 25), Filet of Redgill 13930 +18 (lvl 35), Spinefin Halibut 8957 +18 (lvl 45).",
    "Bait and Tackle crafting menu (spell 1278067) makes camp objects; all share a 1-hour camping cooldown and need a Basic Campfire nearby.",
    "Fish Bowl (Fishing 20): Raw Brilliant Smallfish + Empty Vial; +8% all stats to nearby players (does not stack with Blessing of Kings). Learned from 'Camping 101: Fishing' or any trainer.",
    "Fishing Rack (Fishing 140): 2 Simple Wood, 1 Crystal Vial, 2 Raw Mithril Head Trout; 1 hour of lures + Uncommon fish. Blueprint 273141 from Gelihast (BFD), also reportedly fished from pools. Hotfixes: Nov 10 (lure handout fix), Nov 16 (lures for everyone nearby; Bloated Fish drop chance up, loot tables adjusted).",
    "Fishing Hut (Fishing 300): 5 Simple Wood, 2 Bolt of Runecloth, 1 Seasonal Fish Steaks (273295); 1 hour of lures + Rare fish. Blueprint 273119 from Jammal'an the Prophet (Sunken Temple). The rare-fish list was not published in any source found.",
    "Seasonal Fish Steaks (273295) = Winter Squid (13755) or Raw Summer Bass (13756) cut with the Chef's Knife (273636; fishing vendors, needs Fishing 275), which 'prepares Unique Fish'.",
    "Bloated fish: 10 kinds are now Uncommon + Bind on Pickup and tied to the Fishing Rack (classic has 6 known IDs: 6643, 6645, 6647, 8366, 13881, 13891; the other 4 are unnamed).",
    "New fish: Whimsyfin (251524), Redridge Mountains, from 'School of Whimsyfin' pools -> Savory Whimsyfin Delight (251525; recipe 251526, Cooking 85, a rare drop from Redridge mobs).",
    "New cooking uses: Plated Armorfish (13890) -> Plated Armorfish food (286152, Cooking 225); Zesty Clam Meat -> Clam Linguine (250081, Cooking 275).",
    "New poles/lures: Ravaged Fishing Pole (285094, +15; source given as Lord Angler in Dustwallow or a world drop; conflicting). '\"Secret\" Bait' lure +25 (new). Wide-Brimmed Fishing Hat and Shiny Silver Coin are named as skill boosts.",
    "Legacy profession perks: Luremaster (25%/50% chance of an extra fish while a lure is active), Working Overtime (skill-up chance), Dedicated Study (+1 to lowest tradeskill).",
    "Find Fish (spell 43308) shows nearby pools on the minimap (a TBC+ ability in the original timeline).",
    "Stranglethorn Fishing Extravaganza (Sun 14:00-16:00 region time): the first 50 players per ruleset win (raised further in the Nov 13 hotfix) instead of one winner; rewards are the Arcanite Fishing Pole (19970) + Extravagant Extravaganza Coin (274026), traded to Jang for Surfer Shoes (276274, water walking), Master Angler's Fishing Hat, Empty Fish Bucket, Bitter Baitling pet, Hook of the Master Angler. Tastyfish stack to 40. Rare fish expire after 4h. The Master Angler buff/title lasts about 1 week.",
    "New trainers: Zephras Isle (Baelann Swiftcurrent, Fenn Fairweather, plus Iallion Featherfall and Belandiel Farflight), Krix (Powderfuse Port, Riverglades), and more zone trainers (wowhandbook counts 27). New starter quests: 'Camping 101: Fishing' (lvl 6), 'Bottles and Baubles' (lvl 7, Goldshire), 'Fishin' Time' (lvl 12, Stormwind Harbor).",
    "Fishing suppliers now sell small stocks of raw fish (Mackerel, Mud Snapper, Catfish, Rockscale Cod, Spotted Yellowtail, Spinefin Halibut).",
    "New fishable zones: Riverglades (4 fishing spots, coastal pools, a giant guarded wreckage), City of Dalaran (Eventide Fountain, Violet Hold, Sewers), Mount Hyjal, Zephras Isle (Windsong Lake), Shen'dralas. Skill tiers for these were not published.",
